  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Chlorine bleach is $\\mathrm{NaOCl}$. The hypochlorite ion in chlorine bleach dissociates to give nascent oxygen as shown below.\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{OCl}^{-} \\longrightarrow[\\mathrm{O}]+\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}\r\n$$\r\nTherefore, the reactive species in chlorine bleach is $\\mathrm{OCl}^{-}$\r\nSo, the option (b) is correct.",
    "image": null
  },
